      "The datasheet lists total gate charge Qg = 19 nC, Qgs = 6.3 nC, and Qgd = 4.5 nC at VDS = 15 V, ID = 10 A, VGS = 10 V.",
      "RDS(on) maximums are 0.010 ohm at VGS = 10 V, ID = 10 A and 0.014 ohm at VGS = 4.5 V, ID = 5 A.",
      "Continuous drain current is 10 A at TA = 25 degC and 6 A at TA = 100 degC; pulsed drain current is 50 A.",
